   {"issue": "This Section bars any substitution more than two years after the Closing Date, yet Section 2.05(a) requires substitutions to be deferred until an Opinion of Counsel is delivered and Section 2.02(a) contemplates cure periods running to 360 days and the second anniversary. The absolute bar and the deferral machinery can produce a repurchase obligation with no available substitute remedy.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.31}
 ]},
 {"clause_id": "c021", "issues": [
